[{"text":"FCLoopGetFeynAmpDenominators[expr, {k1,k2,...}, head] extracts all single propagator denominators present in the expression that depend on the loop momenta k1, k2, ....","anchor":"fcloopgetfeynampdenominators"},{"text":"The function returns a list of two elements. The first one contains the original expression with selected denominators wrapped with head. The second one is the list of relevant denominators","anchor":"fcloopgetfeynampdenominators"},{"text":"Setting the option \"Massless\" to Truewill select only massless denominators.","anchor":"fcloopgetfeynampdenominators"},{"text":"The option Momentum specifies the dependency on external momenta. When set to a list of momenta, relevant propagators will be selected irrespective of being massless or massive.","anchor":"fcloopgetfeynampdenominators"},{"text":"Overview, FeynAmpDenominatorCombine.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"amp = Get@FileNameJoin[{$FeynCalcDirectory, \"Documentation\", \"Examples\", \"Amplitudes\", \"Q-Q-massless-2L.m\"}];","anchor":"cb1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FCReloadFunctionFromFile[FCLoopGetFeynAmpDenominators]","anchor":"cb2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"All denominators depending on k1, k2","anchor":"cb2-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FCLoopGetFeynAmpDenominators[amp, {k1, k2}, denHead] // Last","anchor":"cb3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\left\\{\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{(\\text{k1}^2+i \\eta )}\\right),\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{(\\text{k1}^2-\\text{mq}^2+i \\eta )}\\right),\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{(\\text{k2}^2+i \\eta )}\\right),\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{(\\text{k2}^2-\\text{mq}^2+i \\eta )}\\right),\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{((\\text{k1}+\\text{k2})^2+i \\eta )}\\right),\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{((\\text{k1}+\\text{k2})^2-\\text{mq}^2+i \\eta )}\\right),\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{((\\text{k1}-p)^2+i \\eta )}\\right),\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{((\\text{k1}-p)^2-\\text{mq}^2+i \\eta )}\\right),\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{((\\text{k1}-\\text{k2}-p)^2+i \\eta )}\\right),\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{((\\text{k1}-\\text{k2}-p)^2-\\text{mq}^2+i \\eta )}\\right),\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{((\\text{k2}-p)^2+i \\eta )}\\right),\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{((\\text{k2}-p)^2-\\text{mq}^2+i \\eta )}\\right),\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{((\\text{k1}+p)^2+i \\eta )}\\right),\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{((-\\text{k1}+\\text{k2}+p)^2+i \\eta )}\\right)\\right\\}","anchor":"cb3-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"All denominators depending on k1, k2 and the external momentum p","anchor":"cb3-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FCLoopGetFeynAmpDenominators[amp, {k1, k2}, denHead, Momentum -> {p}] // Last","anchor":"cb4","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\left\\{\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{((\\text{k1}-p)^2+i \\eta )}\\right),\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{((\\text{k1}-p)^2-\\text{mq}^2+i \\eta )}\\right),\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{((\\text{k1}-\\text{k2}-p)^2+i \\eta )}\\right),\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{((\\text{k1}-\\text{k2}-p)^2-\\text{mq}^2+i \\eta )}\\right),\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{((\\text{k2}-p)^2+i \\eta )}\\right),\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{((\\text{k2}-p)^2-\\text{mq}^2+i \\eta )}\\right),\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{((\\text{k1}+p)^2+i \\eta )}\\right),\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{((-\\text{k1}+\\text{k2}+p)^2+i \\eta )}\\right)\\right\\}","anchor":"cb4-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"All denominators depending on k1, k2 and the external momentum p as well as massless denominators","anchor":"cb4-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FCLoopGetFeynAmpDenominators[amp, {k1, k2}, denHead, Momentum -> {p}, \"Massless\" -> True] // Last","anchor":"cb5","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\left\\{\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{(\\text{k1}^2+i \\eta )}\\right),\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{(\\text{k2}^2+i \\eta )}\\right),\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{((\\text{k1}+\\text{k2})^2+i \\eta )}\\right),\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{((\\text{k1}-p)^2+i \\eta )}\\right),\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{((\\text{k1}-p)^2-\\text{mq}^2+i \\eta )}\\right),\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{((\\text{k1}-\\text{k2}-p)^2+i \\eta )}\\right),\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{((\\text{k1}-\\text{k2}-p)^2-\\text{mq}^2+i \\eta )}\\right),\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{((\\text{k2}-p)^2+i \\eta )}\\right),\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{((\\text{k2}-p)^2-\\text{mq}^2+i \\eta )}\\right),\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{((\\text{k1}+p)^2+i \\eta )}\\right),\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{((-\\text{k1}+\\text{k2}+p)^2+i \\eta )}\\right)\\right\\}","anchor":"cb5-1","section":"Examples"}]